        {
          "text": "Nkaambo kuzwa kumazwido aazuba akusikila kumabbililo aalyo izina lyangu lilalemekwa akati kabamasi, nkabela koonse koonse tununkilizyo tulatentelwa izina lyangu, acituuzyo cisalala cilatuulwa, nkaambo izina lyangu lili abulemu akati kabamasi, mbwaamba Jehova wamakamu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAL.1.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAL.1.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAL 1:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Pele ipywe mulalisofwaazya mukwaamba kwanu kwakuti, Intafule ya-Jehova ilisofweede amicelo yalyo azilyo zyalyo tazikwe makani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAL.1.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAL.1.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
